// 1-14: swing and capacitor together. Charge it on this side, swing across before the gate shuts.
id l1-14
name 1-14 SWITCHBOARD
tagline charge, recall, swing. the gate waits for nobody.
bg hall
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main capacitor anchor
mechanics current:4 anchor:2 capacitor:1
new -
portion 5 capacitor and swing
portion 6 swing to the gate before it shuts
hardness 5.5
map
